For each rule, read a few sample alerts with iris_alerts_get and propose one concrete tuning:
- exclude: an exclusion on a host, user, process, path, parent process or value that recurs in the sample alerts;
- threshold: a threshold, aggregation or time-window change;
- severity: a lower severity, when the alerts are useful context but not worth triage;
- retire: retire the rule, only when it never produced a true positive;
- investigate: when the samples show no clear pattern, say what to look at.

